{"title":"Ogrewax Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 33) · Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher, Glasswrought Colossus</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · INT/MAG 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 33 <span class=\"muted\">(1041 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/ogrewax-knick\">Ogrewax Knick</a>, 3× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 935 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glasswrought-colossus\" title=\"Glasswrought Colossus - Normal, 16.7% of recorded drops (1 / 6 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5937c516cba955676068.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glasswrought Colossus</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">16.7%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"ogrewax-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/ogrewax-arms\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/ogrewax-arms?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/ogrewa